    letter: `Charles, by the grace of God King of Castile and Aragon, to <b>Ferdinand Magellan</b>, Captain-General,<br><br>The Treaty of Tordesillas gives Portugal the eastern road to the Indies, around Africa. But the world is round! If you can find a <b>passage through or around the New World</b>, Spain can reach the <b>Spice Islands</b> by sailing west.<br><br>You were born in Portugal, but you now sail for Spain. Take five ships and find the strait.`,
