        text: 'Winter is coming, so you anchor at Port San Julián for five months. On Easter night, <b>three Spanish captains mutiny</b>! Meanwhile, the <b>Santiago</b>, sent to scout the coast, is wrecked in a storm (luckily, its crew survives). You meet the tall <b>Tehuelche</b> people and name the land <b>Patagonia</b>.',
