        scene: { sky: 'day', land: 'atoll', items: ['ships2'] },
        text: 'After two months, you sight a tiny island—but there is no water and no food. You name them the <b>Unfortunate Isles</b>. <b>Scurvy</b> spreads: gums swell and teeth fall out. The crew eats biscuits full of worms, sawdust, rats, and leather strips soaked in seawater.',
