        text: 'After <b>98 days</b> at sea, starving sailors finally reach an island. <b>Chamorro</b> people paddle out in fast outrigger canoes. There are misunderstandings over property—Magellan calls them the “Islands of Thieves”—but you finally get fresh food and water.',
