        text: 'Desperate for food, you stop at the Portuguese Cape Verde Islands. Ashore, your sailors discover it is <b>Thursday</b>—but the ship’s log says <b>Wednesday</b>! By sailing west all the way around the world, you “lost” a day. When the Portuguese learn the truth, 13 men are arrested—but the Victoria escapes.',
